  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.sunflower.desc": "They generate one sun every 48 seconds, during the day. Can be found in plains villages",

  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.marigold": "Souci",
  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.marigold.desc": "They generate between 1 and 3 iron or gold nuggets every 5 minutes. Can be found in abandoned mineshafts and shipwrecks",

  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.peashooter": "Pisto-pois",
  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.peashooter.desc": "They shoot one pea every 1,5 seconds. Can be found in desert, savanna, plains, and taiga villages",

  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.snow_pea": "Pois geleur",
  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.snow_pea.desc": "They shoot one frozen pea every 1,5 seconds. Can be found in snowy villages and ancient cities",

  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.repeater": "Double pisto-pois",
  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.repeater.desc": "They shoot two consecutive peas every 1,5 seconds. Can be found in plains villages",

  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.wall_nut": "Noix",
  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.wall_nut.desc": "They protect other plants from zombie attacks. Can be found in all villages",

  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.potato_mine": "Mine patate",
  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.potato_mine.desc": "They take 2 seconds to arm, and then will explode when they get stepped on. Can be found in savanna villages, and jungle temples",

  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.jalapeno": "Jalapeño",
  "bloom_and_doom.advancement.jalapeno.desc": "Can be found in savanna and desert villages",

